# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the CPU, memory, and GPU resources for a managed workflow, and define sizes that match the size of the problem."
msgstr "Pilih sumber daya CPU, memori, dan GPU untuk managed workflow, dan tentukan ukuran yang sesuai dengan besar masalahnya."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a compute profile"
msgstr "Pilih compute profile"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a compute profile {#choose-a-compute-profile}"
msgstr "Pilih compute profile {#choose-a-compute-profile}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed workflows run on compute profiles. A compute profile is a fixed combination of vCPUs, memory, and GPUs, similar to the resources that you request from an HPC scheduler. When you upload a workflow, you map its sizes, such as `S` and `M`, to profiles, and each run picks one of those sizes. The job then runs on its own node with that profile, and keeps the profile until the job ends.\n"
msgstr "Managed workflow berjalan di compute profile. Compute profile adalah kombinasi tetap dari vCPU, memori, dan GPU, mirip dengan sumber daya yang kamu minta dari scheduler HPC. Saat kamu mengunggah workflow, kamu memetakan ukurannya, seperti `S` dan `M`, ke profile, dan setiap run memilih salah satu ukuran itu. Job lalu berjalan di node sendiri dengan profile tersebut, dan mempertahankan profile itu sampai job selesai.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Profile | vCPUs | Memory (GB) | GPUs |\n"
"| - | - | - | - |\n"
"| `8x32` | 8 | 32 | None |\n"
"| `16x128` | 16 | 128 | None |\n"
"| `48x768` | 48 | 768 | None |\n"
"| `128x1500` | 128 | 1500 | None |\n"
"| `24x120x1l40s` | 24 | 120 | 1 L40S |\n"
"| `20x320x2a100` | 20 | 320 | 2 A100 |\n"
"| `80x1200x8a100` | 80 | 1200 | 8 A100 |\n"
"| `160x1792x8h100` | 160 | 1792 | 8 H100 |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Profile | vCPU | Memori (GB) | GPU |\n"
"| - | - | - | - |\n"
"| `8x32` | 8 | 32 | Tidak ada |\n"
"| `16x128` | 16 | 128 | Tidak ada |\n"
"| `48x768` | 48 | 768 | Tidak ada |\n"
"| `128x1500` | 128 | 1500 | Tidak ada |\n"
"| `24x120x1l40s` | 24 | 120 | 1 L40S |\n"
"| `20x320x2a100` | 20 | 320 | 2 A100 |\n"
"| `80x1200x8a100` | 80 | 1200 | 8 A100 |\n"
"| `160x1792x8h100` | 160 | 1792 | 8 H100 |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A profile ID has the form `{cpu}x{memory}`, with memory in GB, or `{cpu}x{memory}x{count}{gpu}` for a profile with GPUs. For example, `24x120x1l40s` has 24 vCPUs, 120 GB of memory, and one NVIDIA L40S GPU.\n"
msgstr "ID profile berbentuk `{cpu}x{memory}`, dengan memori dalam GB, atau `{cpu}x{memory}x{count}{gpu}` untuk profile dengan GPU. Misalnya, `24x120x1l40s` punya 24 vCPU, memori 120 GB, dan satu GPU NVIDIA L40S.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check available profiles {#check-available-profiles}"
msgstr "Cek profile yang tersedia {#check-available-profiles}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see which profiles are available, call `compute_profiles()`:\n"
msgstr "Untuk melihat profile apa saja yang tersedia, panggil `compute_profiles()`:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Look up a profile by its resources {#look-up-a-profile-by-its-resources}"
msgstr "Cari profile berdasarkan sumber dayanya {#look-up-a-profile-by-its-resources}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instead of typing a profile ID, you can describe the resources that your workflow needs with `compute_profile()`, and use the result as a value in `sizes_map`. Pass `cpu` and `memory` in GB, and pass `gpu` for a GPU profile:\n"
msgstr "Alih-alih mengetik ID profile, kamu bisa mendeskripsikan sumber daya yang dibutuhkan workflow dengan `compute_profile()`, lalu memakai hasilnya sebagai nilai di `sizes_map`. Kirim `cpu` dan `memory` dalam GB, dan kirim `gpu` untuk profile GPU:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A `sizes_map` accepts profile IDs and the profiles that `compute_profile()` returns, and you can mix both in one map. To check a profile ID before you upload, pass it to `compute_profile()`, for example `client.compute_profile(\"16x128\")`. If no profile matches, the error lists the available profiles.\n"
msgstr "`sizes_map` menerima ID profile dan profile yang dikembalikan `compute_profile()`, dan kamu bisa mencampur keduanya dalam satu map. Untuk mengecek ID profile sebelum mengunggah, kirim ke `compute_profile()`, misalnya `client.compute_profile(\"16x128\")`. Kalau tidak ada profile yang cocok, error-nya mendaftarkan profile yang tersedia.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`compute_profiles()` returns a list, so you can also filter it yourself. For example, the following code finds the GPU profiles:\n"
msgstr "`compute_profiles()` mengembalikan sebuah list, jadi kamu juga bisa memfilternya sendiri. Misalnya, kode berikut menemukan profile GPU:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set a default compute profile for your workflow {#set-a-default-compute-profile-for-your-workflow}"
msgstr "Tetapkan compute profile default untuk workflow kamu {#set-a-default-compute-profile-for-your-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most workflows start with one size. Map it to a profile with `sizes_map`, and make it the default with `default_size`, when you upload the workflow:\n"
msgstr "Kebanyakan workflow mulai dengan satu ukuran. Petakan ke profile dengan `sizes_map`, dan jadikan default dengan `default_size`, saat kamu mengunggah workflow:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every run of the workflow uses this profile, so you do not need to pass a size when you run it:\n"
msgstr "Setiap run workflow memakai profile ini, jadi kamu tidak perlu mengirim ukuran saat menjalankannya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best practice: match sizes to problem sizes {#best-practice-match-sizes-to-problem-sizes}"
msgstr "Praktik terbaik: sesuaikan ukuran dengan besar masalah {#best-practice-match-sizes-to-problem-sizes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A workflow solves specific problems, and it might require different compute profiles as the problems increase in scale and complexity. With a `sizes_map` for each workflow, you can do the following:\n"
msgstr "Sebuah workflow menyelesaikan masalah tertentu, dan mungkin butuh compute profile yang berbeda seiring masalahnya membesar dan makin kompleks. Dengan `sizes_map` untuk setiap workflow, kamu bisa melakukan hal berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Give large problems enough compute resources to run to completion.\n"
msgstr "Beri masalah besar sumber daya komputasi yang cukup supaya bisa selesai.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prevent small problems from using a larger node than they need.\n"
msgstr "Cegah masalah kecil memakai node yang lebih besar dari yang dibutuhkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can base the sizes on the factors that determine your workflow's memory and CPU use, such as the subspace size, the number of batches, or the number of qubits.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa mendasarkan ukuran pada faktor yang menentukan pemakaian memori dan CPU workflow, seperti ukuran subruang, jumlah batch, atau jumlah qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the sizes {#define-the-sizes}"
msgstr "Tentukan ukurannya {#define-the-sizes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can map up to four sizes, for small (`S`), medium (`M`), large (`L`), and extra-large (`XL`) problems. For example, the following code defines a workflow with three sizes:\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa memetakan hingga empat ukuran, untuk masalah kecil (`S`), sedang (`M`), besar (`L`), dan sangat besar (`XL`). Misalnya, kode berikut mendefinisikan workflow dengan tiga ukuran:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Size rules {#size-rules}"
msgstr "Aturan ukuran {#size-rules}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Size labels must be `S`, `M`, `L`, or `XL`, so a workflow can define up to four sizes. A managed workflow matches labels in uppercase or lowercase, and stores them in uppercase. Two sizes can map to the same profile.\n"
msgstr "Label ukuran harus `S`, `M`, `L`, atau `XL`, jadi sebuah workflow bisa mendefinisikan hingga empat ukuran. Managed workflow mencocokkan label dalam huruf besar maupun kecil, dan menyimpannya dalam huruf besar. Dua ukuran boleh dipetakan ke profile yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A workflow rejects the first upload in the following cases:\n"
msgstr "Workflow menolak unggahan pertama dalam kasus berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A label is not `S`, `M`, `L`, or `XL`.\n"
msgstr "Sebuah label bukan `S`, `M`, `L`, atau `XL`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You set `sizes_map` without `default_size`, or `default_size` without `sizes_map`.\n"
msgstr "Kamu menetapkan `sizes_map` tanpa `default_size`, atau `default_size` tanpa `sizes_map`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`default_size` is not one of the labels in `sizes_map`.\n"
msgstr "`default_size` bukan salah satu label di `sizes_map`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A value in `sizes_map` is not an available compute profile.\n"
msgstr "Sebuah nilai di `sizes_map` bukan compute profile yang tersedia.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change sizes on re-upload {#change-sizes-on-re-upload}"
msgstr "Ubah ukuran saat mengunggah ulang {#change-sizes-on-re-upload}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you upload the workflow again with the same `title`, the managed workflow handles the sizes as follows:\n"
msgstr "Saat kamu mengunggah workflow lagi dengan `title` yang sama, managed workflow menangani ukurannya seperti berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you set `sizes_map`, the new sizes replace all of the stored sizes.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu menetapkan `sizes_map`, ukuran baru menggantikan semua ukuran yang tersimpan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you omit `sizes_map`, the workflow keeps the stored sizes and the default.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu tidak menyertakan `sizes_map`, workflow mempertahankan ukuran dan default yang tersimpan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To change only the default, set `default_size` without `sizes_map`. The value of `default_size` must be one of the stored sizes.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengubah default saja, tetapkan `default_size` tanpa `sizes_map`. Nilai `default_size` harus salah satu ukuran yang tersimpan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set `default_size` every time that you set `sizes_map`. A re-upload does not require `default_size`. If the new sizes do not include the old default, the workflow has no default, and every run without `function_size` fails.\n"
msgstr "Tetapkan `default_size` setiap kali kamu menetapkan `sizes_map`. Unggah ulang tidak mewajibkan `default_size`. Kalau ukuran baru tidak menyertakan default lama, workflow tidak punya default, dan setiap run tanpa `function_size` gagal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a size for each run {#choose-a-size-for-each-run}"
msgstr "Pilih ukuran untuk setiap run {#choose-a-size-for-each-run}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pass `function_size` to `run()` to choose one of the workflow's sizes for that job. If you omit it, the job uses the workflow's default size:\n"
msgstr "Kirim `function_size` ke `run()` untuk memilih salah satu ukuran workflow bagi job itu. Kalau kamu tidak menyertakannya, job memakai ukuran default workflow:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`sizes()` and `get_default_size()` return the sizes that were stored when you loaded the workflow. To see sizes that changed after you loaded the workflow, load it again.\n"
msgstr "`sizes()` dan `get_default_size()` mengembalikan ukuran yang tersimpan saat kamu memuat workflow. Untuk melihat ukuran yang berubah setelah kamu memuat workflow, muat lagi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To read the size and compute profile of the job, call `get_function_size()` and `get_compute_profile()` in your workflow code:\n"
msgstr "Untuk membaca ukuran dan compute profile job, panggil `get_function_size()` dan `get_compute_profile()` di kode workflow kamu:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`source_files/my_workflow.py`**\n"
msgstr "**`source_files/my_workflow.py`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshoot sizes {#troubleshoot-sizes}"
msgstr "Atasi masalah ukuran {#troubleshoot-sizes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Problem | Cause |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| The upload fails with `Invalid size '...'. Valid sizes are: S, M, L, XL.` | A label in `sizes_map` is not one of the four supported labels. |\n"
"| The upload fails with `Unknown compute profile '...' for size '...'.` | A value in `sizes_map` is not an available profile. Check the ID with `compute_profiles()`, or use `compute_profile()` to look it up. |\n"
"| `compute_profile()` fails with `No compute profile matches ...` | No profile has exactly those resources. For a GPU profile, also pass `gpu`. Pick a profile from the list in the error. |\n"
"| The upload fails with `'default_size' is required when 'sizes' is provided.` | The first upload sets `sizes_map` without `default_size`. |\n"
"| `run()` fails with `Unknown function size '...' for this function. Available sizes: ...` | The workflow does not define the size that you passed to `function_size`. |\n"
"| `run()` fails with `This function has no size.` | A re-upload replaced the sizes and removed the default. Upload again with `default_size`, or pass `function_size`. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Masalah | Penyebab |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| Unggahan gagal dengan `Invalid size '...'. Valid sizes are: S, M, L, XL.` | Sebuah label di `sizes_map` bukan salah satu dari empat label yang didukung. |\n"
"| Unggahan gagal dengan `Unknown compute profile '...' for size '...'.` | Sebuah nilai di `sizes_map` bukan profile yang tersedia. Cek ID-nya dengan `compute_profiles()`, atau pakai `compute_profile()` untuk mencarinya. |\n"
"| `compute_profile()` gagal dengan `No compute profile matches ...` | Tidak ada profile dengan sumber daya persis seperti itu. Untuk profile GPU, kirim juga `gpu`. Pilih profile dari daftar di error. |\n"
"| Unggahan gagal dengan `'default_size' is required when 'sizes' is provided.` | Unggahan pertama menetapkan `sizes_map` tanpa `default_size`. |\n"
"| `run()` gagal dengan `Unknown function size '...' for this function. Available sizes: ...` | Workflow tidak mendefinisikan ukuran yang kamu kirim ke `function_size`. |\n"
"| `run()` gagal dengan `This function has no size.` | Unggah ulang menggantikan ukuran dan menghapus default. Unggah lagi dengan `default_size`, atau kirim `function_size`. |\n"
